{"unit_id": "tag:0DV6:statement", "translation": "引理<REF_0001>和<REF_0002>的等价（equivalences）与拉回（pullbacks）相容。例如，假设<MATH_0001>是连通（connected）概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0002>是几何点（geometric point），属于<MATH_0003>，并令<MATH_0004>。则图（diagram）\n<MATHSEG_0001>有限（finite）局部常值（locally constant）集合（sets）的层（sheaves），定义在 <MATHSEG_0002>有限（finite） <MATHSEG_0003>-集合（sets）<MATHSEG_0004>有限（finite）局部常值（locally constant）集合（sets）的层（sheaves），定义在 <MATHSEG_0005>有限（finite） <MATHSEG_0006>-集合（sets）<MATHSEG_0007>\n交换（commutative），其中右侧竖直箭头（arrow）来自连续（continuous）同态（homomorphism）<MATH_0005>，由<MATH_0006>诱导。这立即由《基本（Fundamental）群（Groups）》定理<REF_0003>中的交换图（commutative diagram）得到。其他情形也有类似结果。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "equivalences", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "pullbacks", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "connected", "target_term": "连通"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "geometric point", "target_term": "几何点"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "locally constant", "target_term": "局部常值"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "locally constant", "target_term": "局部常值"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "commutative", "target_term": "交换"}, {"source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "Fundamental", "target_term": "基本"}, {"source_term": "Groups", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "commutative di